
### login a user
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email":"admin@example.com",
  "password":"changeme123"
}

###Extract the tokenfrom login response
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}


### generate a qr-code 
# @name generateQr
POST http://localhost:3000/api/qr/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 66
}

###Extract the id from generate qr code response
@qrId = {{generateQr.response.body.id}}


### get qr-code
GET http://localhost:3000/api/qr/{{qrId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}